# Full texts of other authors' articles (publisher copyright) - kept local only.
# Added 2026-10-17. The GitHub repo is public; PDFs are already ignored by the repo-root .gitignore.
10_USED_Paper_writing/new_publishing_paper/references/incoming/
10_USED_Paper_writing/new_publishing_paper/references/text/
10_USED_Paper_writing/new_publishing_paper/references/pdfs/

# 10_USED_Paper_writing: push own PDF/DOCX/ZIP/PNG files (supplement ESM_2.pdf, review docx, old mini paper).
# Added 2026-10-24. Overrides the repo-root *.pdf/*.docx/*.zip/*.png rules for this folder only.
# Article folders stay out: references/{incoming,text,pdfs} above, and reference_sources/ + journal_TAG/
# (repo-root .gitignore directory rules, which these negations cannot re-include).
!10_USED_Paper_writing/**/*.pdf
!10_USED_Paper_writing/**/*.docx
!10_USED_Paper_writing/**/*.zip
!10_USED_Paper_writing/**/*.png
